COMMENT ON COLUMN v1_archive."Event"."depth" IS 'sub-agent nesting depth';
COMMENT ON COLUMN v1_archive."Event"."at" IS 'when the event was appended';
COMMENT ON COLUMN v1_archive."Event"."type" IS 'event kind such as tool-called or context-loaded';
COMMENT ON COLUMN v1_archive."Event"."body" IS 'JSON payload of the event';
